1113	// into a map suitable for ExtraFiles. We iterate all contributors rather than
1114	// just state.AgentType because multiple agents can share a session_id (for
1115	// example when a repo enables both cursor and claude-code hooks, claude-code's
1116	// session-start can overwrite agent_type in state even though cursor-agent is
1117	// the one actually writing to ~/.cursor/chats/<id>/store.db). Contributors
1118	// that have no data for this session are expected to return wrapped
1119	// os.ErrNotExist, which we treat as a silent no-op.
